            "text": "<h2>Brownies and Bars Shipped Nationwide From Charlotte, NC</h2>\n<p>Sunflour Baking Company's brownies and bars are the real thing. Dense, fudgy, and made from scratch in our Charlotte, NC kitchens. No box mixes, no shortcuts, just the same brownie recipes we have been perfecting since we opened, now available to ship anywhere in the country.</p>\n<p>Our brownie gift boxes make it easy to send something genuinely good. Whether it is a thank you, a get-well, a holiday treat, or just a reason to check in, a box of Sunflour brownies lands differently than anything from a grocery store.</p>\n<h3>What to Expect From a Sunflour Brownie Box</h3>\n<p>Each brownie gift box is packed fresh to order and sealed for transit. We use insulated packaging to protect texture and freshness so what arrives at your recipient's door is as good as what comes out of our oven. Vegan and gluten-friendly bar options are available in select formats.</p>\n<p>Brownie bars stay fresh four to five days at room temperature or up to ten days refrigerated. They also freeze well, which makes them a practical gift for someone who wants to stretch the enjoyment across multiple sittings.</p>\n<h3>Pair Them With Something More</h3>\n<p>Brownies and bars anchor our <a href=\"/collections/pastry-samplers\">sampler boxes</a> and our Zen Zone gift set if you want to pair them with cookies for a more complete spread. Either way, a box of Sunflour brownies is never the wrong call.</p>"
